---
import ProjectLayout from '../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import MermaidDiagram from '../../components/astro/MermaidDiagram.astro';
import { diagrams } from '../../data/diagrams';
---

<ProjectLayout title="GitOps with ArgoCD - Mark Lester Perez" projectTitle="GitOps with ArgoCD">
  <h2>Project Overview</h2>
  <p>
    Implementation of GitOps practices using ArgoCD for automated application deployment
    and configuration management across multiple Kubernetes clusters.
  </p>

  <h2>Technologies Used</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>ArgoCD</li>
    <li>Kubernetes</li>
    <li>Helm</li>
    <li>Kustomize</li>
    <li>GitHub/GitLab</li>
    <li>Sealed Secrets</li>
    <li>Prometheus & Grafana</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Implementation Details</h2>

  <h3>GitOps Setup</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Multi-cluster application deployment</li>
    <li>Environment-specific configurations</li>
    <li>Automated sync policies</li>
    <li>Progressive delivery strategies</li>
    <li>Configuration drift detection</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Security Features</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>RBAC integration</li>
    <li>Secret management</li>
    <li>SSO configuration</li>
    <li>Audit logging</li>
    <li>Policy enforcement</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Monitoring & Alerting</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Deployment metrics</li>
    <li>Sync status monitoring</li>
    <li>Health checks</li>
    <li>Custom dashboards</li>
    <li>Alert configurations</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Architecture Diagram</h2>
  <MermaidDiagram diagram={diagrams.argocd} />

  <h2>Architecture Overview</h2>
  <p>
    The GitOps implementation follows best practices for continuous deployment:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Declarative infrastructure definition</li>
    <li>Git as single source of truth</li>
    <li>Automated reconciliation</li>
    <li>Self-healing capabilities</li>
    <li>Rollback procedures</li>
  </ul>
</ProjectLayout>
